{"id":"8ab645f955c77848","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-analysis-language.md","title":"Language and Standard Semantics of Analysis","display":"df-analysis-language — Language and Standard Semantics of Analysis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-analysis-language","aliases":["89-df-analysis-language"],"display":"df-analysis-language — Language and Standard Semantics of Analysis","depends_on":["[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]"],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-analysis-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-analysis-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analysis-language — Language and Standard Semantics of Analysis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8811191242063297\" href=\"?note=8811191242063297\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-semantics\">89-df-arithmetical-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>数变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_0=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathsf V_0=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{k+1}=\\{X_i^{(k)}\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathsf V_{k+1}=\\{X_i^{(k)}\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>；各类标签两两不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}\\mathsf V_s\">\\(\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}\\mathsf V_s\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>数项只含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S\">\\(0,S\\)</span>；原始逻辑构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall z\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall z\\)</span>（两类变量皆可）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\\)</span> 按本书经典一阶语法的同一展开式使用。构造子自由生成。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 是有限支集的保类型替换：数变量可替为数项，关系变量只能替为同元数关系变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho[z\\mapsto u]\">\\(\\rho[z\\mapsto u]\\)</span> 为单点更新。新鲜变量在所需类型中按最小指标选取。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 是互异的新鲜三元关系变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{U,V}\">\\(\\iota_{U,V}\\)</span> 将 PA 公式关系化到本语言，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 分别表示加法、乘法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_2\">\\(\\iota_2\\)</span> 再以本条定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Add},\\mathsf{Mul}\">\\(\\mathsf{Add},\\mathsf{Mul}\\)</span> 作避免捕获的谓词展开。此为定义性翻译，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\times\">\\(+,\\times\\)</span> 添作原始符号。</li>\n<li>标准结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_2\">\\(\\mathbb N_2\\)</span> 的数域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)\\)</span>。赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 按类型取值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\\in\\omega^0\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\in\\omega^0\\)</span>。所有有限合取、闭合与变量列表按下述指标排序；唯一存在按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!zB=\\exists z(B\\land\\forall w(B[z:=w]\\to w=z))\">\\(\\exists!zB=\\exists z(B\\land\\forall w(B[z:=w]\\to w=z))\\)</span> 展开，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 为新鲜数变量。谓词模板替换先统一改名其绑定变量，再将每个指定谓词应用按下式展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT^2_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf V_0\\cup\\{0\\},\\quad\nT^2_{n+1}\\coloneqq T^2_n\\cup\\{St\\mid t\\in T^2_n\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_nT^2_n,\\\\\nF^2_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t=u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\\cup\n\\{X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)\\mid i,k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2^k\\},\\\\\nF^2_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq F^2_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,A\\lor B,\\forall z A\\mid A,B\\in F^2_n,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_nF^2_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_2(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(k)}\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{j&lt;k}\\mathrm{FV}_2(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\forall zA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t),\\quad\\mathsf{AV}_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t=u),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathsf{AV}_2(B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(\\forall z A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\{z\\},\\\\\nv_i\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(v_i),\\quad0\\rho\\coloneqq0,\\quad(St)\\rho\\coloneqq S(t\\rho),\\\\\n(t=u)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq(t\\rho=u\\rho),\\quad\n(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\rho\\coloneqq\\rho(X_i^{(k)})(\\langle t_j\\rho\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\neg A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\rho),\\quad(A\\lor B)\\rho\\coloneqq A\\rho\\lor B\\rho,\\\\\n\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{w\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\setminus\\{z\\}}\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\rho(w)),\\\\\n\\mathsf z_2(A,z,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathsf{ind}}\\{u\\in\\mathsf V_s\\mid\nz\\in\\mathsf V_s,\\ u\\notin\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho)\\cup\\{z\\}\\},\\\\\n(\\forall z A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall z(A\\rho[z\\mapsto z]),&amp;z\\notin\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho),\\\\\n\\forall u(A\\rho[z\\mapsto u]),&amp;z\\in\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho),\\ u=\\mathsf z_2(A,z,\\rho),\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[z:=u]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\operatorname{id}[z\\mapsto u],\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(k)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ind}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi(0,i),\\quad\\mathsf{ind}(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\pi(k+1,i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_2(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{m-1}A\n\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)=\\{z_0,\\ldots,z_{m-1}\\},\\mathsf{ind}(z_0)&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\mathsf{ind}(z_{m-1})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\quad\\bot_2\\coloneqq\\neg(0=0),\\quad\n\\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\\\\ng_2(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(0,i),\\langle\\rangle),\\quad g_2(0)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(1,0),\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(St)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(2,0),\\langle g_2(t)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(3,0),\\langle g_2(t),g_2(u)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(4,\\pi(k,i)),\\langle g_2(t_j)\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(5,0),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(6,0),\\langle g_2(A),g_2(B)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(\\forall v_iA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(7,i),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(\\forall X_i^{(k)}A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(8,\\pi(k,i)),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner_2&amp;\\coloneqq g_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_2\\coloneqq g_2[\\mathrm{Fml}_2],\\quad\\mathsf{SC}_2\\coloneqq g_2[\\mathrm{Sent}_2],\\quad\n\\mathsf{VC}_2\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ind}[\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}],\\\\\n\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)&amp;\\coloneqq\n[\\forall x\\ U(x,0,x)]\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\ (U(x,Sy,z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t(U(x,y,t)\\land z=St))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\exists!z\\ U(x,y,z)]\\land[\\forall x\\ V(x,0,0)]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\ (V(x,Sy,z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t(V(x,y,t)\\land U(t,x,z)))]\n\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\exists!z\\ V(x,y,z)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Add}(x,y,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V(\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to U(x,y,z)),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Mul}(x,y,z)\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V(\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to V(x,y,z)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(v_i,z)&amp;\\coloneqq z=v_i,\\quad\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(0,z)\\coloneqq z=0,\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(St,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land z=Su),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t+t&#39;,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t&#39;,w)\\land U(u,w,z)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t\\times t&#39;,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t&#39;,w)\\land V(u,w,z)),\\\\\n\\iota_{U,V}(t=t&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t&#39;,w)\\land u=w),\\\\\n\\iota_{U,V}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\iota_{U,V}(A),\\quad\n\\iota_{U,V}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(A)\\lor\\iota_{U,V}(B),\\quad\n\\iota_{U,V}(\\forall v_iA)\\coloneqq\\forall v_i\\iota_{U,V}(A),\\\\\nU(\\vec t)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\Theta[\\vec x:=\\vec t]\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\Theta)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\},\\ |\\vec t|=k),\\\\\n(B\\circ C)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq B[U:=\\Theta]\\circ C[U:=\\Theta]\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}),\\\\\n(\\neg B)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(B[U:=\\Theta]),\\quad\n(\\forall zB)[U:=\\Theta]\\coloneqq\\forall z(B[U:=\\Theta])\\quad(z\\ne U),\\\\\n(\\forall UB)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall UB,\\quad\nC[U:=\\Theta]\\coloneqq C\\quad(C\\in F^2_0,\\ \\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2^k\\ C\\ne U(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\iota_2(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(A)[U:=\\mathsf{Add},V:=\\mathsf{Mul}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_2(v_i,s)&amp;\\coloneqq s(v_i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_2(0,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}_2(St,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_2(t,s)+1,\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models t=u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_2(t,s)=\\operatorname{val}_2(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\operatorname{val}_2(t_j,s)\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle\\in s(X_i^{(k)}),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A),\\quad\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A\\lor B\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A)\\lor(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\forall v_iA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathbb N_2,s[v_i\\mapsto n]\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\forall X_i^{(k)}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\ (\\mathbb N_2,s[X_i^{(k)}\\mapsto R]\\models A),\\\\\ns_0(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad s_0(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathbb N_2\\models S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N_2,s_0\\models S\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT^2_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf V_0\\cup\\{0\\},\\quad\nT^2_{n+1}\\coloneqq T^2_n\\cup\\{St\\mid t\\in T^2_n\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_nT^2_n,\\\\\nF^2_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t=u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\\cup\n\\{X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)\\mid i,k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2^k\\},\\\\\nF^2_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq F^2_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,A\\lor B,\\forall z A\\mid A,B\\in F^2_n,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_nF^2_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_2(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(k)}\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{j&lt;k}\\mathrm{FV}_2(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\forall zA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t),\\quad\\mathsf{AV}_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t=u),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathsf{AV}_2(B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(\\forall z A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\{z\\},\\\\\nv_i\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(v_i),\\quad0\\rho\\coloneqq0,\\quad(St)\\rho\\coloneqq S(t\\rho),\\\\\n(t=u)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq(t\\rho=u\\rho),\\quad\n(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\rho\\coloneqq\\rho(X_i^{(k)})(\\langle t_j\\rho\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\neg A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\rho),\\quad(A\\lor B)\\rho\\coloneqq A\\rho\\lor B\\rho,\\\\\n\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{w\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\setminus\\{z\\}}\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\rho(w)),\\\\\n\\mathsf z_2(A,z,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathsf{ind}}\\{u\\in\\mathsf V_s\\mid\nz\\in\\mathsf V_s,\\ u\\notin\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho)\\cup\\{z\\}\\},\\\\\n(\\forall z A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall z(A\\rho[z\\mapsto z]),&amp;z\\notin\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho),\\\\\n\\forall u(A\\rho[z\\mapsto u]),&amp;z\\in\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho),\\ u=\\mathsf z_2(A,z,\\rho),\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[z:=u]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\operatorname{id}[z\\mapsto u],\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(k)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ind}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi(0,i),\\quad\\mathsf{ind}(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\pi(k+1,i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_2(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{m-1}A\n\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)=\\{z_0,\\ldots,z_{m-1}\\},\\mathsf{ind}(z_0)&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\mathsf{ind}(z_{m-1})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\quad\\bot_2\\coloneqq\\neg(0=0),\\quad\n\\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\\\\ng_2(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(0,i),\\langle\\rangle),\\quad g_2(0)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(1,0),\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(St)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(2,0),\\langle g_2(t)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(3,0),\\langle g_2(t),g_2(u)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(4,\\pi(k,i)),\\langle g_2(t_j)\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(5,0),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(6,0),\\langle g_2(A),g_2(B)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(\\forall v_iA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(7,i),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(\\forall X_i^{(k)}A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(8,\\pi(k,i)),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner_2&amp;\\coloneqq g_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_2\\coloneqq g_2[\\mathrm{Fml}_2],\\quad\\mathsf{SC}_2\\coloneqq g_2[\\mathrm{Sent}_2],\\quad\n\\mathsf{VC}_2\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ind}[\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}],\\\\\n\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)&amp;\\coloneqq\n[\\forall x\\ U(x,0,x)]\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\ (U(x,Sy,z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t(U(x,y,t)\\land z=St))]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\exists!z\\ U(x,y,z)]\\land[\\forall x\\ V(x,0,0)]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\ (V(x,Sy,z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t(V(x,y,t)\\land U(t,x,z)))]\n\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\exists!z\\ V(x,y,z)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Add}(x,y,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V(\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to U(x,y,z)),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Mul}(x,y,z)\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V(\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to V(x,y,z)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(v_i,z)&amp;\\coloneqq z=v_i,\\quad\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(0,z)\\coloneqq z=0,\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(St,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land z=Su),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t+t&#39;,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t&#39;,w)\\land U(u,w,z)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t\\times t&#39;,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t&#39;,w)\\land V(u,w,z)),\\\\\n\\iota_{U,V}(t=t&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t&#39;,w)\\land u=w),\\\\\n\\iota_{U,V}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\iota_{U,V}(A),\\quad\n\\iota_{U,V}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(A)\\lor\\iota_{U,V}(B),\\quad\n\\iota_{U,V}(\\forall v_iA)\\coloneqq\\forall v_i\\iota_{U,V}(A),\\\\\nU(\\vec t)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\Theta[\\vec x:=\\vec t]\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\Theta)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\},\\ |\\vec t|=k),\\\\\n(B\\circ C)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq B[U:=\\Theta]\\circ C[U:=\\Theta]\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}),\\\\\n(\\neg B)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(B[U:=\\Theta]),\\quad\n(\\forall zB)[U:=\\Theta]\\coloneqq\\forall z(B[U:=\\Theta])\\quad(z\\ne U),\\\\\n(\\forall UB)[U:=\\Theta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall UB,\\quad\nC[U:=\\Theta]\\coloneqq C\\quad(C\\in F^2_0,\\ \\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2^k\\ C\\ne U(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\iota_2(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(A)[U:=\\mathsf{Add},V:=\\mathsf{Mul}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_2(v_i,s)&amp;\\coloneqq s(v_i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_2(0,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}_2(St,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_2(t,s)+1,\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models t=u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_2(t,s)=\\operatorname{val}_2(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\operatorname{val}_2(t_j,s)\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle\\in s(X_i^{(k)}),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A),\\quad\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A\\lor B\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A)\\lor(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\forall v_iA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathbb N_2,s[v_i\\mapsto n]\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\forall X_i^{(k)}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\ (\\mathbb N_2,s[X_i^{(k)}\\mapsto R]\\models A),\\\\\ns_0(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad s_0(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathbb N_2\\models S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N_2,s_0\\models S\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关系化解释保留 0、S-only 原始签名。ArGr 的矩阵只有数变量量词；在标准满结构中唯一确定自然数加法和乘法，分析的理解及归纳模式支持相应定义扩张。O 的定义使用带关系参数的 ι，而不把 Add、Mul 的二阶量词藏进“算术矩阵”。谓词模板替换是定义性宏展开，与只允许同类关系变量替换的普通变量替换有不同的类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8811191242063297","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf V_0=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_{k+1}=\\{X_i^{(k)}\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}\\mathsf V_s","display":false},{"tex":"0,S","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall z","display":false},{"tex":"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho[z\\mapsto u]","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{U,V}","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Add},\\mathsf{Mul}","display":false},{"tex":"+,\\times","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle\\in\\omega^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!zB=\\exists z(B\\land\\forall w(B[z:=w]\\to w=z))","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT^2_0&\\coloneqq\\mathsf V_0\\cup\\{0\\},\\quad\nT^2_{n+1}\\coloneqq T^2_n\\cup\\{St\\mid t\\in T^2_n\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_nT^2_n,\\\\\nF^2_0&\\coloneqq\\{t=u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\\cup\n\\{X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)\\mid i,k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2^k\\},\\\\\nF^2_{n+1}&\\coloneqq F^2_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,A\\lor B,\\forall z A\\mid A,B\\in F^2_n,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_nF^2_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(v_i)&\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_2(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(t=u)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(k)}\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{j<k}\\mathrm{FV}_2(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\forall zA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(t)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t),\\quad\\mathsf{AV}_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(t=u),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathsf{AV}_2(B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}_2(\\forall z A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\{z\\},\\\\\nv_i\\rho&\\coloneqq\\rho(v_i),\\quad0\\rho\\coloneqq0,\\quad(St)\\rho\\coloneqq S(t\\rho),\\\\\n(t=u)\\rho&\\coloneqq(t\\rho=u\\rho),\\quad\n(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))\\rho\\coloneqq\\rho(X_i^{(k)})(\\langle t_j\\rho\\mid j<k\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\neg A)\\rho&\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\rho),\\quad(A\\lor B)\\rho\\coloneqq A\\rho\\lor B\\rho,\\\\\n\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{w\\in\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\setminus\\{z\\}}\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\rho(w)),\\\\\n\\mathsf z_2(A,z,\\rho)&\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathsf{ind}}\\{u\\in\\mathsf V_s\\mid\nz\\in\\mathsf V_s,\\ u\\notin\\mathsf{AV}_2(A)\\cup\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho)\\cup\\{z\\}\\},\\\\\n(\\forall z A)\\rho&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall z(A\\rho[z\\mapsto z]),&z\\notin\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho),\\\\\n\\forall u(A\\rho[z\\mapsto u]),&z\\in\\mathsf U_2(A,z,\\rho),\\ u=\\mathsf z_2(A,z,\\rho),\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[z:=u]&\\coloneqq A\\operatorname{id}[z\\mapsto u],\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_2(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(k)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ind}(v_i)&\\coloneqq\\pi(0,i),\\quad\\mathsf{ind}(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\pi(k+1,i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_2(A)&\\coloneqq\\forall z_0\\cdots\\forall z_{m-1}A\n\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)=\\{z_0,\\ldots,z_{m-1}\\},\\mathsf{ind}(z_0)<\\cdots<\\mathsf{ind}(z_{m-1})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_2&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\quad\\bot_2\\coloneqq\\neg(0=0),\\quad\n\\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\\\\ng_2(v_i)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(0,i),\\langle\\rangle),\\quad g_2(0)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(1,0),\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(St)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(2,0),\\langle g_2(t)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(t=u)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(3,0),\\langle g_2(t),g_2(u)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(4,\\pi(k,i)),\\langle g_2(t_j)\\mid j<k\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(5,0),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(6,0),\\langle g_2(A),g_2(B)\\rangle),\\\\\ng_2(\\forall v_iA)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(7,i),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\quad\ng_2(\\forall X_i^{(k)}A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{nd}(\\pi(8,\\pi(k,i)),\\langle g_2(A)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\ulcorner A\\urcorner_2&\\coloneqq g_2(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{FC}_2\\coloneqq g_2[\\mathrm{Fml}_2],\\quad\\mathsf{SC}_2\\coloneqq g_2[\\mathrm{Sent}_2],\\quad\n\\mathsf{VC}_2\\coloneqq\\mathsf{ind}[\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}],\\\\\n\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)&\\coloneqq\n[\\forall x\\ U(x,0,x)]\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\ (U(x,Sy,z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t(U(x,y,t)\\land z=St))]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\exists!z\\ U(x,y,z)]\\land[\\forall x\\ V(x,0,0)]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\ (V(x,Sy,z)\\leftrightarrow\\exists t(V(x,y,t)\\land U(t,x,z)))]\n\\land[\\forall x\\forall y\\exists!z\\ V(x,y,z)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Add}(x,y,z)&\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V(\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to U(x,y,z)),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Mul}(x,y,z)\\coloneqq\\forall U\\forall V(\\mathsf{ArGr}(U,V)\\to V(x,y,z)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(v_i,z)&\\coloneqq z=v_i,\\quad\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(0,z)\\coloneqq z=0,\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(St,z)&\\coloneqq\\exists u(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land z=Su),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t+t',z)&\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t',w)\\land U(u,w,z)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t\\times t',z)&\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t',w)\\land V(u,w,z)),\\\\\n\\iota_{U,V}(t=t')&\\coloneqq\\exists u\\exists w(\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t,u)\\land\\mathsf{TG}_{U,V}(t',w)\\land u=w),\\\\\n\\iota_{U,V}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\neg\\iota_{U,V}(A),\\quad\n\\iota_{U,V}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(A)\\lor\\iota_{U,V}(B),\\quad\n\\iota_{U,V}(\\forall v_iA)\\coloneqq\\forall v_i\\iota_{U,V}(A),\\\\\nU(\\vec t)[U:=\\Theta]&\\coloneqq\\Theta[\\vec x:=\\vec t]\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\Theta)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\},\\ |\\vec t|=k),\\\\\n(B\\circ C)[U:=\\Theta]&\\coloneqq B[U:=\\Theta]\\circ C[U:=\\Theta]\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}),\\\\\n(\\neg B)[U:=\\Theta]&\\coloneqq\\neg(B[U:=\\Theta]),\\quad\n(\\forall zB)[U:=\\Theta]\\coloneqq\\forall z(B[U:=\\Theta])\\quad(z\\ne U),\\\\\n(\\forall UB)[U:=\\Theta]&\\coloneqq\\forall UB,\\quad\nC[U:=\\Theta]\\coloneqq C\\quad(C\\in F^2_0,\\ \\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2^k\\ C\\ne U(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\iota_2(A)&\\coloneqq\\iota_{U,V}(A)[U:=\\mathsf{Add},V:=\\mathsf{Mul}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_2(v_i,s)&\\coloneqq s(v_i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_2(0,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}_2(St,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}_2(t,s)+1,\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models t=u&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_2(t,s)=\\operatorname{val}_2(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models X_i^{(k)}(\\vec t)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\operatorname{val}_2(t_j,s)\\mid j<k\\rangle\\in s(X_i^{(k)}),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\neg A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A),\\quad\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A\\lor B\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models A)\\lor(\\mathbb N_2,s\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\forall v_iA&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathbb N_2,s[v_i\\mapsto n]\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_2,s\\models\\forall X_i^{(k)}A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\ (\\mathbb N_2,s[X_i^{(k)}\\mapsto R]\\models A),\\\\\ns_0(v_i)&\\coloneqq0,\\quad s_0(X_i^{(k)})\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathbb N_2\\models S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N_2,s_0\\models S\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_2).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":8559,"backlinks":[{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\mathsf V_s,\\mathrm{ucl}_2$ 及保类型替换来自 [[89-df-analysis-language]]。$\\mathsf{Term}_0=\\mathrm{Tm}_2$，$\\mathsf{Term}_{k+1}=\\mathsf V_{k+1}$。"},{"id":"d0116d2c9f5af20f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"所有语法、编码、公理和规则取 [[89-df-analysis-language]]、[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]。$\\operatorname{dec}_2$ 是 $g_2$ 在项/公式码像上的逆，其余输入返回固定失败标记 $\\star_2$；$\\operatorname{var}_2=\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}:\\omega\\to\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}$。"},{"id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner_2$、数词、$\\bot_2=\\neg(0=0)$ 取 [[89-df-analysis-language]]。$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$，翻译按有限语法树递归。"},{"id":"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在本书实际使用的实例中，$T=\\mathrm{PA}$ 取算术语法，$T=\\mathrm{An}$ 取 [[89-df-analysis-language]]；两者 $\\mathsf V_T^{\\mathsf N}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}$。这不是把一般规则的定义域缩小到这两个标签。"},{"id":"571457cbee377421","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-language]]、[[89-df-analysis-provability]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-language]]"}],"outgoing":["7f53d84c2164d9c5","ec3012ebbfa291bf","8811191242063297"]}